    // The tech 3 point defence: a Pinch-fusion Cannon. Its charge is squeezed until it
    // fuses (over two seconds, going white), then launched as one shot, the fastest of any
    // Regency gun, that melts the ground where it lands and leaves a knot of fusion burning
    // there. Near the Citadel's weight a shot, a little of it splashed. The shot is laid a
    // little up and arcs onto its mark (`flat_fire`: a direct-fire gun, not artillery), so
    // it reaches over a low rise in the ground; it crosses its full reach in 1.5 s. Model:
    // `regency_fusion_cannon` (`models::regency::turrets::sunspear`), the Citadel's size.
    (
